<p>
  <%= @opened_by ? "#{@opened_by.nickname} started a password reset for your #{@tenant_name} account." : "Somebody asked to reset the password for your #{@tenant_name} account." %>
</p>

<p>
  Open the link below to choose a new one. Signing in everywhere else stops
  working the moment you do.
</p>

<p><%= link_to @url, @url %></p>

<p>
  The link works once, and expires in
  <%= ActiveSupport::Duration.build(PasswordReset.lifetime.to_i).inspect %>. If
  this was not you, nothing has changed yet and you can ignore it — your password
  only changes when somebody opens the link and sets a new one.
</p>
